            "pattern": "^#([0-9a-fA-F]{3}|[0-9a-fA-F]{4}|[0-9a-fA-F]{6}|[0-9a-fA-F]{8})$",
            "patternErrorMessage": "Use a hex color like #CD9BFF (or #RRGGBBAA with transparency).",
            "markdownDescription": "`Function` and `EndFunction`.\n\nDefault: `#9B37E7` · [Restore default](command:dylbillPapyrus.resetColors?%5B%22functionKeyword%22%5D) · [Open color picker](command:dylbillPapyrus.customizeColors)"
