            "patternErrorMessage": "Use a hex color like #CD9BFF (or #RRGGBBAA with transparency).",
            "markdownDescription": "`Property`, `EndProperty` and property flags (`Auto`, `AutoReadOnly`, `Conditional`, `Hidden`, `Mandatory`).\n\nDefault: `#386AFF` · [Restore default](command:dylbillPapyrus.resetColors?%5B%22propertyKeyword%22%5D) · [Open color picker](command:dylbillPapyrus.customizeColors)"
