            "patternErrorMessage": "Use a hex color like #CD9BFF (or #RRGGBBAA with transparency).",
            "markdownDescription": "`Return`.\n\nDefault: `#C586C0` · [Restore default](command:dylbillPapyrus.resetColors?%5B%22returnKeyword%22%5D) · [Open color picker](command:dylbillPapyrus.customizeColors)"
          },
          "dylbillPapyrus.colors.flowKeyword": {
